      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your feeling of disconnection and irrelevance is deeply personal and can be challenging to navigate. It's natural to feel like you're no longer a vital part of the world, especially when change accelerates at such a rapid pace. However, your unique perspectives, experiences, and emotions are still needed and valued by others, even if it's not necessarily in the same ways as before. Your contributions might be more nuanced, but they can still have an impact.",
